# No agent attribution

All git commits and PRs are **human-only**. Never add agent attribution.

## Forbidden

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any agent/bot trailer
- `git commit --trailer` for agent co-authors
- Cursor `attributeCommitsToAgent` / `attributePRsToAgent` (must be `false`)

## Stop-hook loop (automatic fix)

On every agent turn end, `verify-stop.sh` **before** other checks:

1. Disables agent attribution in `~/.cursor/cli-config.json` if re-enabled
2. If any commit has agent `Co-authored-by` trailers and tree is clean with no remotes → **rewrites history** (amend HEAD or filter-branch)
3. If still failing (dirty tree / remotes) → `followup_message` with `AGENT_COAUTHOR` — agent must unblock, then loop retries

Read skill: `.cursor/skills/fix-agent-attribution/SKILL.md`

## Before push to GitHub

```bash
./scripts/verify-cursor-autonomy.sh
```

Must pass: attribution off, **zero** agent trailers in full `git log`.

## Never ask

Do not ask to push while attribution check fails. Fix first via the loop or `./scripts/strip-agent-coauthors-from-history.sh`.
